      "period": "Late Tang",
      "english_name": "Wei Zhuang",
      "wikidata_id": "Q1291502"
    },
    "title": "冬夜",
    "poem": [
      "睡覺寒爐酒半消，客情鄉夢兩遙遙。",
      "無人為我磨心劍，割斷愁腸一寸苗。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_696_025_01",
    "volume": 696,
    "author": {
